    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="05aa9b1d-019d-5ebf-a639-e16ae91d5f19" activityNameId="4bbfd8d5-6afb-5ca6-8813-d7ab27cf7a50" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Heat, biogas, allocation exergy, at SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe, future</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Heat, biogas, allocation exergy, at SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe, future
The multioutput-process 'biogas, burned in SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe delivers the coproducts 'heat, biogas, allocation exergy, at SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe' and 'electricity, biogas, allocation exergy, at SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe'. The exergy allocation is the allocation scheme suggested to be used within the ecoinvent database (e.g. in electricity mixes).;
UUID: e2ce4adc-314d-3928-9168-456c5031d65e
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and working materials for operation.
Location: Biogas input modelled for Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Hybrid system combining a 125 kWe solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) with tubular stack design and a 55kWe micro gas turbine. For central cogeneration use. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 58%, total efficiency 80%. Operation as base load engine with low partial load hours.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e2ce4adc-314d-3928-9168-456c5031d65e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CH</shortname>
